      "id": "scalar-product-definition",
      "label": "向量內積定義",
      "kind": "formula",
      "summary": "兩個向量內積的定義，等於兩向量大小與夾角餘弦的乘積。",
      "latex": "\\vec{A} \\cdot \\vec{B} = AB \\cos \\phi",
      "pages": [
        21
      ]
    },
